In this published copy the robot's name was replaced by "demo" in the test
fixture and tests. Paths written as skills/... refer to the private
workspace this folder came from.

The movement check needs the vector_slam_maze package, published at
https://github.com/P1R4N351/vector-slam-maze. Clone it and set
CARTOGRAPHER_MOVEMENT_PKG to the clone's folder. With that, 32 of the 36
tests pass. The other 4 compare the grammar with three Cartographer scripts
(_cartographer_lib.sh, draft-cartographer-vector-proprio.sh,
_vector_drive.py) that are not published; with those beside this folder as
well, 36 of 36 pass. Without the package, 20 of 36 pass.
